This .gitignore file should be placed at the ROOT of your Unity project.
Unity projects should generally commit:
Assets/
Packages/
ProjectSettings/
User-defined scripts, tools, CI/CD configuration, etc.
Unity-generated caches, temporary files, local IDE files and builds
are ignored below.
Unity .meta files MUST be committed.
============================================================
UNITY GENERATED / CACHED FILES
============================================================

/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/

/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/

/.utmp/

============================================================
UNITY GENERATED SOLUTION / PROJECT FILES
============================================================

/ExportedObj/

*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

Unity generated metadata for IDE/debug files

*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

============================================================
UNITY LOGS / CRASH REPORTS
============================================================

.log
sysinfo.txt
mono_crash.

Crashlytics generated file

crashlytics-build.properties

