gradle-app.setting.lock

============================================================
UNITY PACKAGE MANAGER
============================================================
DO NOT ignore:
Packages/manifest.json
Packages/packages-lock.json
These files define the project's Unity package dependencies.
Package Manager temporary/cache directories

/[Pp]ackages/[Cc]ache/
/[Pp]ackages/[Tt]emp/

